Description: Use system compiler during tests
 The tests use a default configuration which strips the rustc and cargo
 variables, and it will try to download CI prebuilt binaries, making the
 tests unable to pass.
Author: Zixing Liu <zixing.liu@canonical.com>
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2023-07-18
---
This patch header follows DEP-3: http://dep.debian.net/deps/dep3/
Index: rustc/src/bootstrap/src/core/config/config.rs
===================================================================
--- rustc.orig/src/bootstrap/src/core/config/config.rs
+++ rustc/src/bootstrap/src/core/config/config.rs
@@ -1521,7 +1521,6 @@ impl Config {
             }
             rustc
         } else {
-            config.download_beta_toolchain();
             config
                 .out
                 .join(config.build)
@@ -1536,7 +1535,6 @@ impl Config {
             }
             cargo
         } else {
-            config.download_beta_toolchain();
             config
                 .out
                 .join(config.build)
